# This folder holds the RSS funnel's output — the daily candidate pools that Claude reads.
#
# pboat_universe.py (STEP 1 of the pipeline) writes two files here each morning:
#     universe_{YYYY-MM-DD}_ainews.json      (general AI/tech candidates)
#     universe_{YYYY-MM-DD}_watchlist.json   (watchlist-company candidates)
#
# The pboat-data.yml workflow commits them with [skip email]; the Claude Routine reads
# today's file in engine Step 0.5. This .gitkeep just ensures the folder exists in git.
